    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "The problem with this is that when loading initially it would attempt to render twice via the `querySelector` and within the lifecycle itself, as `<algolia-experiences data-experience-id=\"...\" />` would match.\r\nWe would have to add more checks to ensure it doesn't happen.\r\n\r\nNot sure there would be a scenario where you would wanna switch between both modes, except if we want to do custom elements only and ask people to change their code",
